# OBI vocabularies that are NOT served. The noncompositional 1249-term index and vectors are the
# live pair since 2026-11-10 and are committed, so a fresh clone serves without rebuilding.
# These are derived and rebuildable — see data/OBI/README.md "Rebuilding":
#   full 1794      — the unpruned assay branch, an A/B arm only.
#   pruned 701     — the vocabulary that served until 2026-11-10, retired. Still written by
#                    scripts/prune_obi_domain.py stage 2, kept locally for the vocabulary A/B
#                    and as the record of which OBI domains act as retrieval decoys.
data/OBI/obi_assay_full_index.json
data/OBI/obi_assay_full_embeddings.json
data/OBI/obi_assay_pruned_index.json
data/OBI/obi_assay_pruned_embeddings.json
